  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13dd7f603fa63dcbb0013/step-4ab4be00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and a pinch of salt and pepper. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, combine crushed peanuts and panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Dip Malaysian tofu steaks into flour mixture to coat, then into egg and finally in breadcrumb mixture. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13dd7f603fa63dcbb0013/step-4980a610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook crumbed tofu in batches until golden and cooked through, 2-4 mins each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13dd7f603fa63dcbb0013/step-360dbc20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide garlic rice and salad between bowls. Top with Malaysian peanut-crumbed tofu. Drizzle with sesame dressing to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13dd7f603fa63dcbb0013/step-baaae630.jpeg"
    }
  ]
